The voice behind the door goes quiet, which is worse than the complaining. Then the intercom clicks, and it comes back thin. "Bleakhold? That's days. I don't think the frost gives me days." Under your hand the deck tilts as the nav console takes the course. The compass needle never leaves the locker door.

*Committing the ship to Bleakhold with someone freezing aboard is a Set a Course, if you mean to go through with it.*

